Package: fastecon
Type: Package
Title: Fast Tools for Rolling and Panel Regressions
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Mengqi Li
Maintainer: mengqi.work@gmail.com
Description: 
  fastecon is a lightweight R package that helps you run econometric regressions quickly. 
  It includes a fast rolling window OLS function, with more tools coming soon 
  for fixed effects models, clustered bootstraps, and LaTeX table output.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: data.table, parallel
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
